{'symbol': 'INTU', 'date': '2022-12-07 15:14:00', 'title': "BLOOMERANG ACCELERATES NONPROFITS' ABILITY TO KEEP FUNDRAISING AND FINANCIAL OPERATIONS IN HARMONY", 'text': "BLOOMERANG AND \xa0 INTUIT QUICKBOOKS COLLABORATION HELPS CREATE FINANCIAL TRANSPARENCY FOR NONPROFITS INDIANAPOLIS , DEC. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BLOOMERANG , THE COMPLETE DONOR RELATIONSHIP MANAGEMENT SOLUTION FOR THOUSANDS OF SMALL AND MEDIUM-SIZED NONPROFITS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS SIGNED A QUICKBOOKS SOLUTION PROVIDER SALES AND MARKETING AGREEMENT WITH INTUIT \xa0(NASDAQ: INTU), THE GLOBAL FINANCIAL TECHNOLOGY PLATFORM THAT MAKES\xa0 TURBOTAX ,\xa0 CREDIT KARMA ,\xa0 QUICKBOOKS , AND\xa0 MAILCHIMP . THIS RELATIONSHIP BRINGS A NEW LEVEL OF VISIBILITY AND RECONCILIATION BETWEEN BLOOMERANG'S DONOR RELATIONSHIP MANAGEMENT SOFTWARE AND INTUIT QUICKBOOKS TO HELP STREAMLINE NONPROFITS' ABILITY TO EFFECTIVELY MANAGE THE ENTIRE CONSTITUENT ECOSYSTEM."}